Content Licenses & Attributions
================================

The Qamar codebase (SPEC.md §24, §8.5) bundles third-party datasets. Each
entry below records: source, edition, license, URL, and retrieval date.

This file is populated during Phase 1 (SPEC §25) as the content pipeline
(`scripts/build-quran-content.ts`) ingests each dataset. The Settings → About
screen renders these attributions in-app.

